s5::oveq1 |- ( k = 2 -> ( k - 1 ) = ( 2 - 1 ) )
s6:s5:oveq2d |- ( k = 2 -> ( 1 / ( k - 1 ) ) = ( 1 / ( 2 - 1 ) ) )
